Ye kiska Alam utha ye kiski nishaani hai<br>
lipti hui parham se ek gham ki kahani hai<br>
<br>
bache shahe wala ke do roz se pyaase hai<br>
aur saamnne ankho'n ke behta hua paani hai<br>
<br>
Ankho'n me pade halqe aur kaante zabano par<br>
dam tod na de bacche wo tashna dahani hai<br>
<br>
Aye khuwate dil tooti sarwar ko sahaara de<br>
Peeri me jawa'n bete ki lash uthaani hai<br>
<br>
Jab yaad teri aaye ankho'n se lahu tapka<br>
besheer teri kitni purdard kahani hai<br>
<br>
laila se koi kehde ab dekhle jee bhar ke<br>
mitne ko koi dam me akbar ki jawaani hai<br>
